    "cautions": [
      {
        "zh": "跪着的膝盖下面垫个软垫",
        "en": "Put a soft pad under the kneeling knee."
      },
      {
        "zh": "大腿后侧疼时坐得少一点，还疼就停",
        "en": "If the back of your thigh hurts, sit back less, and stop if it still hurts."
